sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitante
  participant W as Widget (iframe)
  participant S as Servidor
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant A as Console do Agente
  participant SM as SMAdapter (mock)
  V->>W: abre o widget
  W->>S: GET /public/widgets/:publicId
  S-->>W: configurações e filas (sem token)
  W->>S: POST /visitor/sessions {sitePublicId, parentOrigin}
  S->>DB: valida allowed_origins, cria visitor + sessão (hash)
  S-->>W: token
  W->>S: WS /visitor (auth.token)
  Note over W,S: Comando: queue.list
  V->>W: escolhe a fila
  W->>S: conversation.start {queueId, displayName?}
  S->>DB: INSERT conversations (queued) + evento queued
  S-->>W: ack {ok: true, ...}
  S-)W: evento conversation.updated / queue.position
  S-)A: evento conversation.updated (sala da fila)
  S--)SM: onConversationQueued (após commit, falha ignorada)
  A->>S: conversation.claim {conversationId}
  S->>DB: UPDATE ... WHERE status='queued' (atômico, exige presença available)
  S-->>A: ack
  S-)W: evento conversation.updated (assigned)
  S--)SM: onConversationAssigned
  loop troca de mensagens
    V->>W: digita
    W->>S: message.send {conversationId, requestId, body}
    S->>DB: INSERT messages (idempotente por requestId)
    S-->>W: ack {messageId, created}
    S-)A: evento message.new
    A->>S: message.send / message.read
    S-)W: evento message.new
  end
  A->>S: conversation.close {conversationId, dispositionId}
  S->>DB: status = awaiting_survey
  S-->>A: ack
  S--)SM: onConversationClosed
  S-)W: evento survey.required + conversation.updated
  W->>S: survey.submit {score, comment?}
  S->>DB: INSERT survey_responses, status = closed
  S-->>W: ack
